         search of the excess</td></tr>
 <tr><td><tt>EliasFanoGraph</tt></td>
     <td>\f$ m ( 2 + \lceil \log_2( n^2 / m ) \rceil ) + n ( 2 + \lceil
         \log_2( m / n ) \rceil ) \f$</td>
     <td>the outdegree and the \f$ i \f$-th successor in \f$ O( 1 ) \f$,
         an edge in \f$ O( 1 ) \f$ expected</td></tr>
 <tr><td><tt>BVGraph</tt></td>
     <td>about 3 per edge on the Web graphs</td>
     <td>a list in \f$ O( R d ) \f$, \f$ R \f$ the longest chain of
         references</td></tr>
 <tr><td><tt>K2Tree</tt></td>
     <td>\f$ k^2 m ( \log_{k^2}( n^2 / m ) + O( 1 ) ) \f$ in the worst
